WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.940
A machine costs 20,000 to make.

2
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.040
Sent across one border, it pays no tax.

3
00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.340
Across a different border, it
picks up a 10 per cent tariff,

4
00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.560
and costs 22,000.

5
00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:16.130
The 27 countries of the European
Union charge each other no tariffs.

6
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:18.370
Goods from outside still pay.

7
00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.750
So why would a group of
countries agree to drop

8
00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.580
the taxes on each other's goods,

9
00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.520
but not on everyone else's?

10
00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:27.860
In this mission, you'll climb
three levels of trading bloc,

11
00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:29.680
up to a single market.

12
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.850
Then you'll follow one machine's
price across the borders,

13
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.880
and see who wins the sale.

14
00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.540
Your mission: find out
what a trade deal does

15
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.220
for the countries inside it,

16
00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.590
and those outside.
